name hyphenat
category Package
revision 77682
shortdesc Disable/enable hyphenation
longdesc This package can disable all hyphenation or enable hyphenation
longdesc of non-alphabetics or monospaced fonts. The package can also
longdesc enable hyphenation within 'words' that contain non-alphabetic
longdesc characters (e.g., that include underscores), and hyphenation of
longdesc text typeset in monospaced (e.g., cmtt) fonts.
